.TH DRAGONGL_RESET_WORLD 1 "2026-08-24" "DragonGL 2026.05.26.01" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dragongl_reset_world \- reset the Dragon GL world state
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dragongl_reset_world
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dragongl_reset_world
wipes all player saves, tombstones, and the world persistence state of a
Dragon GL installation (artifacts, NPCs, bones, logs). After confirmation,
the next server start will generate a brand new world.

The script is interactive: it asks for confirmation (y/n) before deleting
anything and must be run from the project root directory.
.SH FILES REMOVED
.TP
.IR saves/*.save
Player save files.
.TP
.IR saves/tombstone_*.dat
Tombstone files (death locations and loot, reloaded by the server at start).
.TP
.IR data/world.dat ", " data/artifacts.dat ", " data/npcs.dat ", " data/bones_*.dat
World persistence files.
.TP
.IR combat_log.json ", " map_dump.txt ", " server_log.txt
Log and dump files.
.SH WARNING
This operation is destructive and cannot be undone: all player progress and
world state will be lost.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dragongl-server (1)
